== Notes ==
{{Bug|This infusion causes certain textures to not display, or to display incorrectly. Effects or textures such as [[Media:Mistwalker Infusion with Photon Forge.jpg|Photon Forge]] and Stealth do not display. Armor skins such as [[Media:Mistwalker Infusion with Battlelord's Hood.jpg|Battlelord's Hood Helm]] incorrectly display pieces of the character's face.}}
* While the individual infusions are account bound, the container they are in, {{item icon|Ball of Charged Mists Essence}}, can be sold and purchased on the [[Trading Post]].
* With one infusion applied, a character will gain a light blue aura visually similar to that provided by [[Equip Mist-Step Travel Skills]] in Armistice Bastion (or the [[Potion of Ascalonian Mages]], except with your own character model).
* With three infusions applied, the aura gains a hue based on the current World versus World team's color while the character is in World versus World.

